+*   **Access Pattern:** A mapping from each camera view to the subset of point IDs it renders [S1, unofficial].
+*   **GPU Assignment Maps:** Mappings from point IDs to GPU IDs and from image IDs to GPU IDs [S1, unofficial].
 
